      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Himanshu here. This creates a race condition where a L2CAP Fixed channel request could be denied even when we eventually do get a link setup. Ideally we should not be canceling the alarm for lcb from l2cap but since we do that when initializing a CCB we should atleast check the link state before doing so. \n\nCan we get a test case (preferably automated) to reproduce this issue more sustainably and try out multiple fixes with it?",
